voxtype: fetch the Parakeet model configured in config/config.toml:
  /usr/lib/voxtype/voxtype-onnx-cuda-13 setup --download --model parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
  (/usr/bin/voxtype is a Whisper-only build and refuses Parakeet models)
Dictate by holding Right Alt (bound in the hypr submodule). The daemon is
started by Hyprland's autostart (systemctl --user start voxtype.service),
since graphical-session.target never activates without uwsm.
